    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28472" root="عذق" body-key="E">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعذق</span></b> : see 1, first sentence. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>He</i> (a
man) <i>had many</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُذُوق</span>, i. e. <i>palm-trees,</i> pl. of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَذْقٌ</span>. (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعذقت النَّخْلَةُ</span> <i>The palm-tree
had many</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْذَاق</span>, i. e. <i>racemes,</i> or <i>bunches of dates,</i>
pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِذْقٌ</span>. (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also 1, latter half.

